---
// Hero copy is the live site's own wording, not the prototype's. The prototype
// tightened the thesis sentence into a headline; the repo's phrasing wins.
---

<section class="hero" id="evidence" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
	<p class="kicker">Causal inference · AI evaluation · B2B decision science</p>

	<h1 id="hero-heading">
		Most analytics questions look like they need a query and actually need an identification
		strategy.
	</h1>

	<p class="lead">
		I build things that make the difference measurable: synthetic data with planted ground truth, so
		estimates and agents can be <em>scored rather than argued about</em>.
	</p>

	<div class="actions">
		<a class="btn-primary" href="#case-studies">See the case studies</a>
		<a class="btn-secondary" href="/about">Read the About page</a>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.hero {
		padding: 64px 56px 48px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
	}

	.kicker {
		margin: 0 0 26px;
		font-family: var(--mono);
		font-size: var(--fs-kicker);
		letter-spacing: var(--track-kicker);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0 0 26px;
		font-family: var(--serif);
		font-size: var(--fs-display);
		font-weight: 600;
		line-height: 1.06;
		letter-spacing: -0.022em;
		max-width: 16em;
		text-wrap: balance;
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	.lead {
		margin: 0 0 34px;
		font-size: var(--fs-lead);
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--body);
		max-width: 32em;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.lead em {
		font-style: normal;
		border-bottom: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 35%, transparent);
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 12px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.actions a {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 11px 20px;
		font-size: var(--fs-link);
		font-weight: 500;
		text-decoration: none;
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		transition: background-color 120ms ease, border-color 120ms ease, color 120ms ease;
	}

	.btn-primary {
		background: var(--ink);
		color: var(--page);
	}

	.btn-primary:hover {
		background: var(--accent);
	}

	.btn-secondary {
		border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	.btn-secondary:hover {
		border-color: var(--ink);
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.hero {
			padding: 40px 24px 36px;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.2rem + 3.6vw, 3.625rem);
		}
	}
</style>
